## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to design cross-tenant ordering, handle late arrivals, and preserve at-least-once delivery with idempotence in a KCNA-like streaming system.

## Key Concepts
- Per-tenant sequencing and a central Sequencer
- Idempotent downstream sink with deduplication
- Watermark-based late-arrival handling
- Cross-tenant isolation and scalable design
- Testing strategies: chaos, delays, churn

## Code Example
